---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import SectionDivider from '../components/SectionDivider.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="J Wanders Off Again"
  description="Real trips. Real stories. No filter. Honest travel stories from a family figuring it out one trip at a time."
  ogUrl="https://jwandersoffagain.pages.dev/"
  ogImage="https://jwandersoffagain.pages.dev/og-image.jpg"
  pinterestDescription="Real trips. Real stories. No filter. Honest travel stories from a family figuring it out one trip at a time."
>
  <Nav/>

  <!-- ── HERO ── -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <div class="hero-kicker">Family · Friends · Romantic · Solo</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Real trips. Real stories.
        <em>No filter.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">Hi, I'm J. Real travel looks nothing like the highlight reel.</p>
      <p class="hero-body">
        Just honest travel stories from someone figuring it out one trip at a time. From where we stayed to what went sideways.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#posts" class="btn-primary">Read the posts</a>
        <a href="#about" class="btn-text">Meet J →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="vis-card vis-main"></div>
      <div class="vis-card vis-lower"></div>
      <div class="vis-card-float">
        <div class="float-stamp">✈️</div>
        <div class="float-line1">Passport stamps</div>
        <div class="float-line2">over perfection</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SectionDivider/>

  <!-- ── POSTS ── -->
  <section class="posts-section" id="posts">
    <div class="posts-header">
      <div class="posts-label">From the Wanders</div>
    </div>

    <div class="posts-grid">
      <a href="/posts/nyc" class="post-card">
        <div class="pc-img" style="background-image: url('/images/PXL_20260503_001952153.jpg');"></div>
        <div class="pc-body">
          <div class="pc-tag">Romantic Getaway · New York City</div>
          <h3 class="pc-title pc-title-small">New York City</h3>
          <p class="pc-excerpt">Two nights in NYC as a Canadian couple — the food, the hype, the brutal exchange rate, and the one dinner I'm still thinking about.</p>
          <div class="pc-meta"><span>May 2026</span><span>·</span><span>5 min read</span></div>
          <span class="pc-read">Read the post →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/posts/la" class="post-card">
        <div class="pc-img" style="background-image: url('/images/index-img-004.jpg');"></div>
        <div class="pc-body">
          <div class="pc-tag">Friends Trip · Los Angeles</div>
          <h3 class="pc-title pc-title-small">Los Angeles</h3>
          <p class="pc-excerpt">A girls trip to celebrate a friend's birthday. Free accommodation, the best fish tacos I've ever eaten, a hike I wasn't ready for, and a Dodgers game that did not disappoint.</p>
          <div class="pc-meta"><span>April 2026</span><span>·</span><span>4 min read</span></div>
          <span class="pc-read">Read the post →</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SectionDivider/>

  <!-- ── ABOUT ── -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="about-img-wrap">
      <div class="about-photo"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="section-kicker">The wanderer behind the blog</div>
      <h2 class="about-title">
        Hi there, I'm J<br/>
        <em>and I'm glad you found me.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="about-body">If you're here, maybe you're looking for something a little more real. So am I.</p>
      <p class="about-body">I'm a mother to two little girls, and this past year has been my year where I crashed and burned due to high stress which I developed high anxiety. Even though it is still early into the year, so far it has also been a year where I learn self-love, self-care and setting realistic expectations. Overall just being kind to myself (still practicing self-compassion).</p>
      <p class="about-body">I decided to create a travel blog to capture the highs and lows of travelling. I was tired of seeing others who travelled staying at high-end places, eating expensive food, and experiencing experiences that are way out of our budget.</p>
      <div class="about-callout">
        <p>So here's what I do instead. I share the honest version of every trip. Where we stayed and why, what it cost, what the kids thought, what went wrong, and whether I'd do it again. No sponsorships, no perfection. Just real experiences.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="about-body">I am here to share with you my side of travelling. As a family, with friends, romantic getaways and solo trips. I want to share the ups and downs, the tantrums and tears, while still enjoying the beauty of what the world has to offer.</p>
      <p class="about-body">I hope you enjoy my journey. Learn with me and grow with me.</p>
      <a href="#newsletter" class="about-link">Come along for the ride →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SectionDivider/>

  <!-- ── NEWSLETTER ── -->
  <section class="newsletter" id="newsletter">
    <div class="nl-inner">
      <div class="nl-badge">✦ &nbsp; New posts coming soon</div>
      <h2 class="nl-title">
        More posts<br/>
        <em>on the way.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="nl-body">
        Drop your email and you'll be the first to know when something new goes live. No fluff, just real stories.
      </p>
      <div class="nl-form">
        <input type="email" class="nl-input" placeholder="your@email.com" aria-label="Email address"/>
        <button class="nl-btn">Notify me</button>
      </div>
      <p class="nl-note">No spam. Just updates when I post.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer/>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    padding: 5.5rem 6% 4.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -120px; right: -80px;
    width: 580px; height: 580px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 55% 40%, rgba(90,126,158,0.08) 0%, transparent 62%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px; left: 6%;
    width: 380px; height: 380px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212,168,176,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-text { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

  .hero-kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blush);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .hero-kicker::before {
    content: '';
    width: 26px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--blush);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5.4vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.07;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .hero-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--denim);
    font-weight: 300;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 420px;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .hero-body {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--ink-mid);
    max-width: 420px;
    line-height: 1.92;
    margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.3rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--denim);
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.85rem 2.1rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: all 0.24s;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(90,126,158,0.25);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--denim-h);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(90,126,158,0.3);
  }

  .btn-text {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--ink-mid);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    transition: color 0.2s, gap 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-text:hover { color: var(--denim); gap: 0.6rem; }

  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    height: 500px;
  }

  .vis-card {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .vis-main {
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 62%; height: 62%;
    background: url("/images/index-img-001.jpg") center center / cover no-repeat;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 56px rgba(90,126,158,0.26);
  }

  .vis-lower {
    bottom: 0; left: 0;
    width: 58%; height: 55%;
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, #E4B8C0 0%, #B88090 100%);
    border: 3px solid var(--ivory);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(212,168,176,0.28);
  }

  .vis-card-float {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 25%; left: -18px;
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(26,32,40,0.1);
    z-index: 4;
    max-width: 215px;
  }

  .float-stamp { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }

  .float-line1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .float-line2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--denim);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 0.18rem;
  }

  /* ── POSTS ── */
  .posts-section {
    padding: 5rem 6%;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .posts-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .posts-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .posts-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .post-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    background: var(--ivory);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26,32,40,0.07);
  }

  .post-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(26,32,40,0.12);
  }

  .pc-img {
    height: 200px;
    background: center center / cover no-repeat;
  }

  .pc-body {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .pc-tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--denim);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .pc-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .pc-title-small { font-size: 1.4rem; }

  .pc-excerpt {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink-mid);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .pc-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pc-read {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--denim);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .post-card:hover .pc-read { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* ── ABOUT ── */
  .about {
    padding: 6.5rem 6%;
    background: var(--ivory);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.65fr;
    gap: 5.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-img-wrap { position: relative; }

  .about-photo {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 460px;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: url("/images/index-img-002.jpg") 50% bottom / cover no-repeat;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 50px rgba(90,126,158,0.18);
  }

  .section-kicker {
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--denim); }

  .about-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-mid);
    line-height: 1.92;
    margin-bottom: 0.95rem;
  }

  .about-callout {
    margin: 1.6rem 0;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.4rem;
    background: var(--denim-pale);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--denim);
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
  }

  .about-callout p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--denim);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    transition: gap 0.2s;
  }

  .about-link:hover { gap: 0.65rem; }

  /* ── NEWSLETTER ── */
  .newsletter {
    padding: 6rem 6%;
    background: var(--white);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .newsletter::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -80px; right: -60px;
    width: 420px; height: 420px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(90,126,158,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .newsletter::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px; left: 30%;
    width: 320px; height: 320px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212,168,176,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .nl-inner {
    max-width: 580px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .nl-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--blush-pale);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,176,0.3);
    color: var(--denim);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.32rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 1.7rem;
  }

  .nl-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .nl-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--denim); }

  .nl-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-mid);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
    max-width: 470px;
  }

  .nl-form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .nl-input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 220px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ivory-line);
    border-radius: 50px;
    background: var(--ivory);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.22s, box-shadow 0.22s;
  }

  .nl-input::placeholder { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .nl-input:focus {
    border-color: var(--denim);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(90,126,158,0.1);
  }

  .nl-btn {
    background: var(--denim);
    color: var(--white);
    border: none;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.9rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.22s;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(90,126,158,0.22);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .nl-btn:hover {
    background: var(--denim-h);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(90,126,158,0.28);
  }

  .nl-note { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  .hero-text > * { animation: fadeUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both; }
  .hero-text > *:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
  .hero-text > *:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.18s; }
  .hero-text > *:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.32s; }
  .hero-text > *:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.48s; }
  .hero-visual { animation: fadeIn 1.1s ease both; animation-delay: 0.2s; }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 4rem 6% 3.5rem;
      gap: 3.5rem;
    }
    .hero-visual { height: 320px; }
    .vis-main  { width: 65%; height: 68%; top: 0; }
    .vis-lower { width: 56%; height: 52%; bottom: 0; }
    .vis-card-float { left: 0; }
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      padding: 4.5rem 6%;
    }
    .about-photo { max-width: 240px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero { padding: 3rem 5% 2.5rem; }
    .hero-title { font-size: 2.6rem; }
    .about { padding: 4rem 5%; }
    .about-body { font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .newsletter { padding: 4rem 5%; }
    .nl-form { flex-direction: column; }
    .posts-section { padding: 3.5rem 5%; }
  }
</style>
